# Cloudflare Pages configuration

The build output is pre-built and located in `react-app/dist/`.

## Deployment

This project uses:
- **Framework**: React 18 with Vite
- **Build Output**: `react-app/dist/`
- **Functions**: `/functions/api/` (Cloudflare Pages Functions)

Cloudflare Pages is configured in `wrangler.toml` to serve from `react-app/dist/`.
